Version v1.5.2

CHANGELOG:  
- Changed `World.hpp` directory: `Game/World.hpp` -> `Game/World/World.hpp`
- Changed `HitResult.hpp` directory: `Game/HitResult.hpp` -> `Game/World/HitResult.hpp`
- Moved actor rotation to texture; actor collision is unaffected by rotation
- Added Unicode texture rendering via `Texture` and `TextureManager`
    - Rotation renders correctly with texture and char texture
- Extracted physics logic to `PhysicsController`
- Added random generators to `GameplayHelpers`
- Consolidated engine subsystem class hierarchies and added friending via macro
- Refactored tick system with multiple tick groups and better tick checks
- Engine links against curses statically, so developers no longer need to link it themselves
- Ensured hit events generate even without physics simulation (added `CollisionType::None` to disable hit events)
- Added Raycasting via `Raycast`

PATCHLOG:
- Fixed a constructor overload redeclaration issue in some singletons
- Fixed an issue with engine subsystem singleton construction ordering 
- Increased collision broadphase check distance from `100` to `10,000`
- Fixed an issue where registering a tickable object broke the existing tick loop
- Fixed an issue where destroyed actors would crash tick update check

